# Frontend conventions

- Types: `src/types.ts`. Models: `src/config/models.ts`. API client: `src/services/gemini.ts`.
- Persistence: IndexedDB via `src/lib/db.ts` for the library; draft in `comicskido_last_story`.
- When adding UI copy, update all languages in `src/translations.ts` (EN, HE, FR, ES, DE). Hebrew needs RTL-safe layout.
- Keep engine selection visible; generation failures should show the error and allow retry.
- Prefer extracting focused components/hooks over growing `App.tsx` further when touching new UI.
